      <title>American Support for Taiwan Looks Alarmingly Fragile</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-15/american-support-for-taiwan-looks-alarmingly-fragile</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">1f3a4b645f8bb9ef66010644</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:00:04 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Donald Trump has been humiliated in the midterms, but his ability to exploit American might to cause grief abroad is not much diminished. US policy toward Iran remains uncertain, probably even in the White House. The administration is persisting in its attempts to sell Ukraine to Russia. Trump’s threats against Cuba linger.</description>
