      <title>Chicago's Broadview Six Case Shows How the DOJ Is Losing Public Trust</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-14/chicago-s-broadview-six-case-shows-how-the-doj-is-losing-public-trust</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">c7fd5889e5616474a88d412c</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 13:00:05 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>When government lawyers appear in federal court, they enjoy something called “the presumption of regularity,” which is a fancy way of saying that judges give them the benefit of the doubt. President Donald Trump’s administration is now in danger of squandering this trust — to the detriment of not only federal prosecutors, but also public safety.</description>
